{"strongs": "H2504", "word": "חָלָץ", "translit": "cha.lats", "root": "חלמש", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun [feminine]", "gloss": "loins", "definition": "[ חָלָץ ] noun [feminine] only dual, loins (as seat of strength, vigour; compare Aramaic חַרְצָא hip, loin , Syriac , Nö ZMG 1886, 741 ) — חֲלָצָ֑יִם Isa 32:11 suffix חֲלָצֶיךָ Gen 35:11 + 4 t.; חֲלָצָיו Isa 5:27 + 2 t.; חלצו Kt Job 31:20 , Qr חֲלָצָיו ; — loins: 1. as seat of virility ׳ יצא מן ח Gen 35:11 ( P ), 1Kgs 8:19 ; 2Chr 6:9 . 2. as girded אֱזָרֿ ׳ נָא כְּגֶבֶר ח Job 38:3 ; Job 40:7 אֵזוֺר חֲלָצָיו Isa 5:27 (see אֵזוֺר ), וַחֲג֫וֺרָה עַל חֲלָצָ֑יִם Isa 32:11 , compare Job 31:20 where the clothed loins are conceived as blessing charitable giver; metaphor Isa 11:5 faithfulness waist-cloth of his loins (|| מתניו ). 3. as seat of pains, like a woman's in travail, Jer 30:6 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2807')\">BDB2807</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2504')\">H2504</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2806')\">BDB2806</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2808')\">BDB2808</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>חָלָץ</bdbheb>] <b>noun [feminine]</b> only dual, <highlightword>loins</highlightword> (as seat of strength, vigour; compare Aramaic <bdbarc>חַרְצָא</bdbarc> <highlight>hip, loin</highlight>, Syriac <placeholder1786/>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG 1886, 741</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>חֲלָצָ֑יִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref> suffix <bdbheb>חֲלָצֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,11)\">Gen 35:11</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>חֲלָצָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,27)\">Isa 5:27</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>חלצו</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"Job 31:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,20)\">Job 31:20</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>חֲלָצָיו</bdbheb>; — <highlight>loins:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as seat of virility <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יצא מן ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,11)\">Gen 35:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,19)\">1Kgs 8:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,9)\">2Chr 6:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> as girded <bdbheb>אֱזָרֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נָא כְּגֶבֶר ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,3)\">Job 38:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,7)\">Job 40:7</ref> <bdbheb>אֵזוֺר חֲלָצָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,27)\">Isa 5:27</ref> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֵזוֺר</reflink></bdbheb>), <bdbheb>וַחֲג֫וֺרָה עַל חֲלָצָ֑יִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,11)\">Isa 32:11</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 31:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,20)\">Job 31:20</ref> where the clothed loins are conceived as blessing charitable giver; metaphor <ref ref=\"Isa 11:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,5)\">Isa 11:5</ref> faithfulness waist-cloth of his loins (|| <bdbheb>מתניו</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> as seat of pains, like a woman's in travail, <ref ref=\